{% comment %}
  Swamp Mode — Brand Story Section
  PLACEHOLDER MODE: Static content until Shopify is active.
{% endcomment %}

<section class="brand-story section-padding" id="brand-story">
  <div class="brand-story__grid">
    <div class="brand-story__image-wrap">
      <img src="{{ 'brand-story.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Swamp Mode" class="brand-story__image" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600">
      <div class="brand-story__accent-line"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="brand-story__text">
      <span class="brand-story__eyebrow">Nuestra Historia</span>
      <h2>Nacidos en el <span class="accent-text">Pantano</span></h2>
<p class="brand-story__desc">Swamp Mode nace desde la calle y la cultura urbana chilena, con una propuesta que mezcla identidad, exclusividad y actitud en cada drop.</p>
<p class="brand-story__desc">Diseñamos ediciones limitadas para quienes buscan vestir con intención, diferenciarse y formar parte de una comunidad que no sigue tendencias: las crea.</p>
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary">Conoce Swamp Mode →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% stylesheet %}
  .brand-story { background-color: var(--color-surface); }
  .brand-story__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--space-2xl); align-items: center; }
  .brand-story__image-wrap { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .brand-story__image { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; }
  .brand-story__accent-line { position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; width: 60%; height: 3px; background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--color-accent), transparent); }
  .brand-story__text { padding: 0 var(--space-md); }
  .brand-story__eyebrow { display: inline-block; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: var(--color-accent); margin-bottom: var(--space-md); }
  .brand-story__desc { color: var(--color-muted-light); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: var(--space-lg); max-width: 50ch; }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .brand-story__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: var(--space-4xl); }
    .brand-story__image { aspect-ratio: 3 / 4; }
    .brand-story__text { padding: var(--space-2xl) 0; }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Brand Story",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Brand Story", "category": "Swamp Mode" }]
}
{% endschema %}
